    <string name="privacy_in_app">Coach Fitness PRO stores your session history, water totals and preferences locally on this device. It has no account, advertising, analytics SDK, tracking or network permission. We do not receive this information. Android backups are disabled. Delete local information using Profile → Delete all my data, Android app settings, or uninstall. Emailing support uses your email provider and shares the content you choose to send. Support messages are used to answer your request and kept only as needed. The public policy may be opened in your browser, where your browser and hosting provider handle web requests. Developer: PT Deploy Dulu Pulang Nanti. Contact: seandyadryan2@gmail.com. Effective: 19 October 2026.</string>
